                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As a licensed healthcare provider, I know that firing HHS workers strains our hospitals and puts lives at risk \u2014 delaying treatments, denying cures, and stealing hope from patients. These cuts are more than numbers on a balance sheet \u2014 these are lives that hang in the balance. https://t.co/xl9CGBxTi8",
