                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "These amendments are about protecting people, making sure families don\u2019t lose access to care, hospitals don\u2019t collapse, and those who can least afford it aren\u2019t left behind. Healthcare isn\u2019t a luxury reserved for the rich, it\u2019s a right. No matter what time of day Republicans try to force these cuts through, I\u2019ll keep fighting. \ud83e\uddf5",
