                "quoted_status_id": "1932108014904816141",
                "quoted_status_profile_id": "43805270",
                "quoted_status_profile_username": "TheBuffaloNews",
                "reply_count": 17,
                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump's \"Big Ugly Bill\" would rip $13.5 BILLION from New York\u2019s healthcare system.\n\nIn Western NY, premiums could spike nearly 40%\u2014that\u2019s $267 more a month for working families.\n\nAs an occupational therapist, I've seen what happens when families can't afford care: minor conditions become chronic, emergency room wait times increase, and lives are put at risk.\n\nWe need everyone in this fight \u2014 stand up, speak out, and push back. Our healthcare is on the line.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1749504371,
                "view_count": 2113
            },
