                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The One Big Ugly Bill is a broken promise to the American people that fails our communities.\n\nGutting funding for Medicaid, Medicare, and the Affordable Care Act puts hospitals and healthcare facilities on the brink of collapse. It leaves seniors, people with disabilities, and low-income families without the care they need. And increases healthcare costs for all Americans.\u00a0\n\nThe fallout from this betrayal will be devastating in WNY and across the country.\u00a0\n\nCongressional Republicans need to stand up for hardworking families and #CanceltheCuts.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1752690838,
                "view_count": 408
            },
