                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 4,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today in Amherst, I stood with patients, workers, and community leaders outside Buffalo Therapy Services \u2013 one of several Kaleida facilities set to close because of Trump and Congressional Republicans\u2019 Medicaid cuts.\u00a0\n\nThese closures are exactly what we warned would happen when the GOP forced through Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Law. Facilities shutting down, costs rising, and care disappearing.\u00a0\n\nAs an occupational therapist, I know the life-changing work done here. The patients who rely on this care deserve better than partisan games in Washington. Congressional Republicans need to cancel the cuts, extend the ACA enhanced tax credits, and fix the healthcare crisis they\u2019ve created.\u00a0\n\nLives are on the line.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
                "text_tags": null,
                "timestamp": 1758560394,
                "view_count": 372
            },
