                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 6,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We have been sounding the alarm for months that further cuts to our healthcare system will devastate our communities, our constituents, our hospitals, and our nursing homes. But despite these warnings, Donald Trump and Congressional Republicans have put their billionaire donors ahead of working families.\u00a0\n\nThis healthcare crisis is completely preventable if Congressional Republicans return to Washington to cancel the cuts.",
