                "quoted_status_profile_username": "TheBuffaloNews",
                "reply_count": 5,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Trump and Congressional Republicans didn\u2019t just fail to fix healthcare - they made it worse.\n\nThey gutted funding for hospitals and pushed the biggest healthcare cuts in history to pay for billionaire tax breaks. Now Western New York is seeing clinics close, jobs vanish, and care disappear because of their failed policies.\n\nThis is what happens when Republicans choose politics over people. I\u2019m fighting to reverse these cuts and make sure every Western New Yorker gets the care they deserve.",
