                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Families in Western New York, and across our nation, are living through a full-blown healthcare crisis.\n\nUnder Trump and Congressional Republicans, patients are facing skyrocketing premiums and losing access to care because of devastating federal cuts. To make matters worse, they\u2019ve made it nearly impossible for future nurses, therapists, counselors, and other essential providers to afford their education, deepening an already dire workforce shortage.\n\n@HouseDemocrats won\u2019t stand by while healthcare is stripped away from working families. We\u2019re fighting to protect patients, safeguard providers, and ensure healthcare is a right for all \u2013 not a luxury \u2013 in the richest nation on Earth.",
